---
import InfoLayout from '../layouts/InfoLayout.astro';
import { totalToolsCount } from '../data/tools';
---

<InfoLayout title="About Us | FreeOnlineToolkit" description="FreeOnlineToolkit.org provides 80+ free online calculators and tools. Learn about our mission, expertise, and commitment to accuracy and privacy.">
  <h1 class="animate-in">About FreeOnlineToolkit</h1>

  <h2 class="animate-in"><i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye"></i> Our Mission</h2>
  <p class="animate-in animate-in-delay-1">FreeOnlineToolkit.org was created with a simple mission: provide <strong>fast, accurate, and completely free</strong> online calculators and tools for everyone. We believe that essential calculation tools — from mortgage payments to health metrics — should be accessible to all, without signups, hidden fees, or complicated interfaces.</p>
  <p class="animate-in animate-in-delay-2">Every tool on this site is designed with a single goal: give you the answer you need in seconds, with clear explanations of how the result was calculated.</p>

  <h2 class="animate-in"><i class="fa-solid fa-calculator"></i> What We Offer</h2>
  <p class="animate-in animate-in-delay-1">Our platform currently features <strong>{totalToolsCount}+ free tools</strong> across multiple categories, each built with accuracy and usability as top priorities:</p>
  <ul>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-1"><strong>Financial Calculators</strong> — Mortgage, loans, savings, investments, and retirement planning tools using standard financial formulas</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-2"><strong>Health &amp; Wellness</strong> — BMI, body fat, calorie, due date, and fertility calculators based on established medical formulas</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-3"><strong>Conversion Tools</strong> — Currency, unit, time zone, and color converters with accurate reference data</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-4"><strong>Utility Tools</strong> — Password generator, QR code generator, word counter, and more for everyday tasks</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-5"><strong>Business Calculators</strong> — Startup valuation, ROI, loan repayment, and SaaS metrics for entrepreneurs</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-6"><strong>Legal Estimators</strong> — Personal injury, workers comp, divorce cost, and patent cost estimation tools</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-7"><strong>Educational Tools</strong> — GPA calculator, final grade planner, and college cost estimators for students</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-8"><strong>And many more</strong> — Automotive, food and kitchen, lifestyle, and home improvement calculators</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="animate-in"><i class="fa-solid fa-book-open"></i> Our Expertise</h2>
  <p class="animate-in animate-in-delay-1">Our calculators are built using established formulas and methodologies from recognized sources:</p>
  <ul>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-1"><strong>Financial tools</strong> follow standard industry formulas (amortization, compound interest, DTI ratios, NPV calculations) used by financial institutions</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-2"><strong>Health calculators</strong> use clinically validated methods (Naegele Rule for due dates, US Navy method for body fat, Devine and Hamwi formulas for ideal weight)</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-3"><strong>Legal estimators</strong> are based on published settlement data and common industry multiplier methods</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-4"><strong>Conversion tools</strong> use official reference rates and standardized unit definitions</li>
  </ul>
  <p class="animate-in animate-in-delay-2">Each tool includes inline explanations of the formula used, so you understand not just the result but how it was derived. Our 15 in-depth guides provide further educational context for the most popular tools.</p>

  <h2 class="animate-in"><i class="fa-solid fa-file-circle-check"></i> Our Commitment to Accuracy</h2>
  <p class="animate-in animate-in-delay-1">We take accuracy seriously. Every calculator on this site undergoes systematic testing:</p>
  <ul>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-1">Each tool is tested with known inputs and compared against verified results</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-2">Edge cases (zero values, very large numbers, negative inputs) are handled explicitly</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-3">Formulas are reviewed against industry standards and updated when necessary</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-4">User feedback about potential errors is investigated and resolved promptly</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="animate-in"><i class="fa-solid fa-heart"></i> Why We're Different</h2>
  <ul>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-1"><strong>100% Free</strong> — No subscription, no credit card, no hidden charges. Everything is free, always.</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-2"><strong>No Signup Required</strong> — Use any tool instantly without creating an account.</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-3"><strong>Privacy First</strong> — All calculations run in your browser. Your data never leaves your device.</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-4"><strong>Fast &amp; Accurate</strong> — Real-time results with precise calculations every time.</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-5"><strong>Works Everywhere</strong> — Optimized for desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.</li>
    <li class="animate-in animate-in-delay-6"><strong>Regularly Updated</strong> — We continuously improve our tools and add new ones based on user requests.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 class="animate-in"><i class="fa-regular fa-envelope"></i> Get in Touch</h2>
  <p class="animate-in animate-in-delay-1">Have a suggestion, feedback, or found a bug? We'd love to hear from you. Visit our <a href="/contact/">Contact page</a> to send us a message. We review every submission and use your input to improve the site.</p>
</InfoLayout>
